# Candidate pools are a pure filter over the env's own jsonl -- seconds to
# rebuild, and large. The calibrated manifests are not: each one carries the
# outcome of a g=4 rollout over thousands of tasks (8,903 trajectories, 6.75 h
# for the combined3 pass), so they stay tracked.
data/*.candidates.seed42.parquet
data/*.candidates.seed42.summary.json
